{"step_index":963,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:33:06Z","thinking":"**Deriving minimum inequality**\n\nThe goal is to prove `s.min.getD 0 ≤ b` given `b ∈ s`. Begin by noting `s.inf f ≤ f b` and `s.min s = s.inf WithTop.some`, leading to `s.min ≤ WithTop.some b` for any `b` in `s`. This means `s.min` is equivalent to `WithTop.some m` where `m ≤ b`, resulting in the inequality `s.min.getD 0 ≤ b`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' > scratch.lean\\nimport Mathlib\\n\\nlemma finset_min_getD_le {s : Finset ℕ} {b : ℕ} (hb : b ∈ s) :\\n    s.min.getD 0 ≤ b := by\\n  have h : s.min ≤ WithTop.some b := Finset.inf_le hb\\n  cases hm : s.min with\\n  | none =>\\n    rw [hm] at h\\n    cases h\\n  | some m =>\\n    rw [hm] at h\\n    exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp h\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Testing finset_min_getD_le\"","toolSummary":"\"Test finset_min_getD_le lemma\""}}]}
{"step_index":964,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:33:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:33:09+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 77001943-b7df-4df1-ba5c-db7288bf8e72/task-964\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' > scratch.lean\nimport Mathlib\n\nlemma finset_min_getD_le {s : Finset ℕ} {b : ℕ} (hb : b ∈ s) :\n    s.min.getD 0 ≤ b := by\n  have h : s.min ≤ WithTop.some b := Fins